<title>USA: TABLE - CITGO Q2 net higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CITGO Q2 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net			 72,700		   31,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,400,000		3,300,000</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net			 85,500		   46,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,700,000		6,000,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q2 1997 income from operations was $129.2 million compared to $78 million for Q2 1996. Six-month 1997 income from operation was $179.7 million vs $127.1 million for the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Full name of company is CITGO Petroleum Corp. It is owned by PDV America Inc, an indirect, wholly owned subsidiary of Petroleos de Venezuela SA, the national oil company of Venezuela.</p>
